  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expenditure will facilitate the publicatino of a Brazilian Edition of the Climate Justice book. The aim of the project is to use the book as a launching pad that starts a climate justice movement in Brazil. To accomplish that, in phase one of the project, ACLIMA will plan a series of events that helps to propel the book&#x2019;s distribution, including the promotion of activities in vulnerable communities.</narrative>
